/// `CPfxRigidBody`: the engine's wrapper around a Havok rigid body in the physics system's world,
/// an engine physics instance ([`PfxInstance`]) for one body. It is allocated with the engine's
/// [`OperatorNew`](memory::OperatorNew) and destroyed through its deleting destructor
/// ([`Destruct`](Self::Destruct)), which removes the body from the world and destroys it. Only some
/// members are bound.
